# Image PII pipeline. WORKER ONLY — must never enter the gateway's web image.
#
# The gateway API signs uploads and reads asset rows; it never decodes an image.
# Processing takes seconds and belongs in a worker regardless, which is what
# keeps ~500MB of models out of every API instance.
-c constraints.txt
-r worker.in
# NOTE: no `cloudinary` SDK. It is synchronous, and the surface used — upload,
# destroy, a delivery URL — is small enough that wrapping every call in a thread
# costs more than the REST API over httpx, which is already a base dependency.
pillow                 # decode, re-encode, variants, redaction masks
mediapipe              # face detection, in-process — see pii-handling.md
pytesseract            # OCR; needs the tesseract system binary
open-clip-torch        # zero-shot safety classification
torch
boto3                  # R2 backup replication; SigV4 is too easy to hand-roll wrong
